  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Entrance portals",
   "anchor": "vstupni-portaly"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "These are frames around the entrance door, in an illuminated or non-illuminated version, differing in design. Portals can incorporate logos, lettering or a message.",
   "anchor": "vstupni-portaly"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Materials: portals are built on an aluminium structure that can house LEDs. Depending on the lighting required, it is clad either in acrylic or in composite sheet material, which is non-illuminated.",
   "anchor": "vstupni-portaly"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Execution: a 3D sign can be mounted on the portal, or it can be made as an acrylic glass inlay. The portal can be illuminated, non-illuminated or fitted with raised lettering. Our team will create an individual design that respects what the building allows.",
   "anchor": "vstupni-portaly"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: at the entrances to shops or company premises, to mark the way in clearly, attract attention and give visitors the information they need.",
   "anchor": "vstupni-portaly"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "vstupni-portaly"
  },
