  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Architectural illuminated elements",
   "anchor": "architektonicke-prvky"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We specialise in illuminated lines on building façades, façade lighting, dynamic advertising and façade bands. Our priority is to find the best technical and visual solution.",
   "anchor": "architektonicke-prvky"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Materials: we use high-quality LED modules with a high IP rating – they stand up to the weather and ensure a long service life.",
   "anchor": "architektonicke-prvky"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Execution: alongside the design we also handle technical details, secure fixings and adaptation to the particular space, materials and operating conditions. The result is a clean solution with high functionality and a long service life.",
   "anchor": "architektonicke-prvky"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "architektonicke-prvky"
