  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Advertising flags",
   "anchor": "vlajky"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We make textile advertising flags including flagpoles, ideal wherever there is no room for other types of advertising such as billboards or large display signs.",
   "anchor": "vlajky"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Execution: you can choose the shape of the flag to suit the location – we offer traditional rectangles as well as special shapes. Flags are made from quality materials that give them a long service life.",
   "anchor": "vlajky"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: they work best where large numbers of people pass by, such as city streets, shopping centres, festivals or trade fairs. Because they move in the wind, flags can draw even more attention, which makes them more effective.",
   "anchor": "vlajky"
  },
  {
